  autosize,                                                !- Gross Rated Total Cooling Capacity {W}
  autosize,                                                !- Gross Rated Sensible Heat Ratio
  3,                                                       !- Rated COP
  autosize,                                                !- Rated Air Volume Flow Rate {m3/s}
  ,                                                        !- 2017 Rated Evaporator Fan Power per Volume Flow Rate {W/(m3/s)}
  ,                                                        !- 2023 Rated Evaporator Fan Power Per Volume Flow Rate {W/(m3/s)}
  Main Zone PTAC PTAC Mixed Air Outlet,                    !- Air Inlet Node Name
  Main Zone PTAC PTAC Cooling Coil Outlet,                 !- Air Outlet Node Name
  Main Zone PTAC PTAC Cooling Coil Cap-FT,                 !- Total Cooling Capacity Modifier Curve (function of temperature)
  Main Zone PTAC PTAC Cooling Coil Cap-FF,                 !- Total Cooling Capacity Modifier Curve (function of flow fraction)
  Main Zone PTAC PTAC Cooling Coil EIR-FT,                 !- Energy Input Ratio Modifier Curve (function of temperature)
  Main Zone PTAC PTAC Cooling Coil EIR-FF,                 !- Energy Input Ratio Modifier Curve (function of flow fraction)
